    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10138" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιμεθίστημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>move from one side to the other, revolutionize,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψηφίσματα καὶ νόμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					362
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, with aor. 2 and pf.
			
				Act.
			, <i>exchange places,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀλλήλοις τό τε ὕδωρ καὶ ὁ ἀήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					209b25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				211b27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mete.</u>
				366b20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					8.241a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make countermoves,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Dem.Enc.</u>
				37
			</span></i>.</div>
